## OpenCode apply_patch protocol

The apply_patch protocol surface (Begin/End Patch markers, Add/Update/Delete
headers, @@ hunks, and related user-facing rules) follows the OpenCode-style
file-oriented patch format documented by pi-base. The Java implementation in
this module is an independent reimplementation and does not copy OpenCode or
pi-base program source.

Source: https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode

